#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_001
msgid ""
"Information security policy and topic-specific policies shall be defined, "
"approved by management, published, communicated to and acknowledged by "
"relevant personnel and relevant interested parties, and reviewed at planned "
"intervals and if significant changes occur."
msgstr ""
"La política de seguridad de la información y políticas específicas deben ser"
" definidas, aprobadas por la dirección, publicadas, comunicadas y conocidas "
"tanto por el personal como por las partes interesadas pertinentes, además "
"revisadas en intervalos planificados y cuando ocurran cambios significativos"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_002
msgid ""
"Information security roles and responsibilities shall be defined and "
"allocated according to the organization needs."
msgstr ""
"Los roles y responsabilidades de seguridad de la información deben definirse"
" y asignarse de acuerdo con las necesidades de la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_003
msgid ""
"Conflicting duties and conflicting areas of responsibility shall be "
"segregated."
msgstr ""
"Funciones en conflicto y áreas de responsabilidad en conflicto deben ser "
"segregadas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_004
msgid ""
"Management shall require all personnel to apply information security in "
"accordance with the established information security policy, topic-specific "
"policies and procedures of the organization."
msgstr ""
"La dirección debe requerir a todo el personal que aplique la seguridad de la"
" información de acuerdo con la política de seguridad de la información "
"establecida, las políticas y procedimientos específicos de la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_005
msgid ""
"The organization shall establish and maintain contact with relevant "
"authorities."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe establecer y mantener contacto con las autoridades "
"pertinentes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_006
msgid ""
"The organization shall establish and maintain contact with special interest "
"groups or other specialist security forums and professional associations."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe establecer y mantener contacto con grupos especiales de"
" interés u otros foros y asociaciones profesionales especializados en "
"seguridad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_007
msgid ""
"Information relating to information security threats shall be collected and "
"analysed to produce threat intelligence."
msgstr ""
"La información relacionada con las amenazas a la seguridad de la información"
" debe ser recopilada y analizada para producir inteligencia sobre las "
"amenazas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_008
msgid "Information security shall be integrated into project management."
msgstr ""
"La seguridad de la información debe estar integrada en la gestión de "
"proyectos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_009
msgid ""
"An inventory of information and other associated assets, including owners, "
"shall be developed and maintained."
msgstr ""
"Un inventario de información y otros activos asociados, incluidos los "
"propietarios, debe ser desarrollado y mantenido"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_010
msgid ""
"Rules for the acceptable use and procedures for handling information and "
"other associated assets shall be identified, documented and implemented."
msgstr ""
"Reglas para el uso aceptable y procedimientos para el manejo de la "
"información y otros activos asociados debe ser identificada, documentada e "
"implementada."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_011
msgid ""
"Personnel and other interested parties as appropriate shall return all the "
"organization's assets in their possession upon change or termination of "
"their employment, contract or agreement."
msgstr ""
"El personal y otras partes interesadas, según sea apropiado, deben devolver "
"todos los activos de la organización en su posesión cuando cambien o "
"terminen su empleo, contrato o acuerdo."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_012
msgid ""
"Information shall be classified according to the information security needs "
"of the organization based on confidentiality, integrity, availability and "
"relevant interested party requirements."
msgstr ""
"La información debe ser clasificada de acuerdo con las necesidades de "
"seguridad de la información de la organización en función de la "
"confidencialidad, la integridad, la disponibilidad y los requisitos de las "
"partes interesadas pertinentes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_013
msgid ""
"An appropriate set of procedures for information labelling shall be "
"developed and implemented in accordance with the information classification "
"scheme adopted by the organization."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de procedimientos apropiado para el etiquetado de información "
"debe ser desarrollado e implementado en concordancia con el esquema de "
"clasificación de la información adoptado por la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_014
msgid ""
"Information transfer rules, procedures, or agreements shall be in place for "
"all types of transfer facilities within the organization and between the "
"organization and other parties."
msgstr ""
"Deben existir reglas, procedimientos o acuerdos de transferencia de "
"información para todos los tipos de instalaciones para transferencia, dentro"
" de la organización y entre la organización y otras partes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_015
msgid ""
"Rules to control physical and logical access to information and other "
"associated assets shall be established and implemented based on business and"
" information security requirements."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas para controlar el acceso físico y lógico a la información y otros"
" activos asociados deben establecerse e implementarse en función de los "
"requisitos del negocio y de seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_016
msgid "The full life cycle of identities shall be managed."
msgstr "El ciclo de vida completo de identidades debe ser gestionado."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_017
msgid ""
"Allocation and management of authentication information shall be controlled "
"by a management process, including advising personnel on the appropriate "
"handling of authentication information."
msgstr ""
"La asignación y gestión de la información de autenticación debe ser "
"controlada por un proceso de gestión, incluyendo el asesoramiento al "
"personal sobre el manejo adecuado de la información de autenticación."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_018
msgid ""
"Access rights to information and other associated assets shall be "
"provisioned, reviewed, modified and removed in accordance with the "
"organization's topic-specific policy on and rules for access control."
msgstr ""
"Los derechos de acceso a la información y otros activos asociados deben ser "
"aprovisionados, revisados, modificados y removidos en concordancia con la "
"política específica de la organización y las reglas para el control de "
"acceso."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_019
msgid ""
"Processes and procedures shall be defined and implemented to manage the "
"information security risks associated with the use of supplier's products or"
" services."
msgstr ""
"Deben definirse e implementarse procesos y procedimientos para gestionar los"
" riesgos de seguridad de la información asociados con el uso de productos o "
"servicios del proveedor."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_020
msgid ""
"Relevant information security requirements shall be established and agreed "
"with each supplier based on the type of supplier relationship."
msgstr ""
"Los requisitos de seguridad de la información pertinentes deben establecerse"
" y acordarse con cada proveedor en función del tipo de relación con el "
"proveedor."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_021
msgid ""
"Processes and procedures shall be defined and implemented to manage the "
"information security risks associated with the ICT products and services "
"supply chain."
msgstr ""
"Deben definirse e implementarse procesos y procedimientos para gestionar los"
" riesgos de seguridad de la información asociados con la cadena de "
"suministro de productos y servicios de las TIC."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_022
msgid ""
"The organization shall regularly monitor, review, evaluate and manage change"
" in supplier information security practices and service delivery."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe hacer seguimiento, revisar,  evaluar y gestionar "
"periódicamente los cambios en las prácticas de seguridad de la información "
"del proveedor y la prestación de servicios."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_023
msgid ""
"Processes for acquisition, use, management and exit from cloud services "
"shall be established in accordance with the organization's information "
"security requirements."
msgstr ""
"Los procesos de adquisición, uso, gestión y salida de los servicios en la "
"nube deben establecerse de acuerdo con los requisitos de  seguridad de la "
"información de la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_024
msgid ""
"The organization shall plan and prepare for managing information security "
"incidents by defining, establishing and communicating information security "
"incident management processes, roles and responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe planificar y preparar la gestión de los incidentes de "
"seguridad de la información definiendo, estableciendo y comunicando los "
"procesos, las funciones y las responsabilidades de gestión de incidentes de "
"seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_025
msgid ""
"The organization shall assess information security events and decide if they"
" are to be categorized as information security incidents."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe evaluar los eventos de seguridad de la información y "
"decidir si se categorizan como incidentes de seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_026
msgid ""
"Information security incidents shall be responded to in accordance with the "
"documented procedures."
msgstr ""
"Se debe responder a los incidentes de seguridad de la información de acuerdo"
" con los procedimientos documentados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_027
msgid ""
"Knowledge gained from information security incidents shall be used to "
"strengthen and improve the information security controls."
msgstr ""
"El conocimiento obtenido de los incidentes de seguridad de la información "
"debe utilizarse para fortalecer y mejorar los controles de seguridad de la "
"información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_028
msgid ""
"The organization shall establish and implement procedures for the "
"identification, collection, acquisition and preservation of evidence related"
" to information security events."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe establecer e implementar procedimientos para la "
"identificación, recolección, adquisición y preservación de evidencia "
"relacionada con eventos de seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_029
msgid ""
"The organization shall plan how to maintain information security at an "
"appropriate level during disruption."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe planificar cómo mantener la seguridad de la información"
" en un nivel apropiado durante una interrupción."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_030
msgid ""
"ICT readiness shall be planned, implemented, maintained and tested based on "
"business continuity objectives and ICT continuity requirements."
msgstr ""
"La preparación de las TIC debe planificarse,  implementarse, mantenerse y "
"probarse en función de los objetivos de continuidad del negocio y los "
"requisitos de continuidad de las TIC."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_031
msgid ""
"Legal, statutory, regulatory and contractual requirements relevant to "
"information security and the organization's approach to meet these "
"requirements shall be identified, documented and kept up to date."
msgstr ""
"Los requisitos legales, estatutarios, regulatorios y contractuales "
"pertinentes para la seguridad de la información y el enfoque de la "
"organización para cumplir con estos requisitos deben identificarse, "
"documentarse y mantenerse actualizados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_032
msgid ""
"The organization shall implement appropriate procedures to protect "
"intellectual property rights."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe implementar procedimientos apropiados para proteger los"
" derechos de propiedad intelectual."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_033
msgid ""
"Records shall be protected from loss, destruction, falsification, "
"unauthorized access and unauthorized release."
msgstr ""
"Los registros deben protegerse contra pérdida, destrucción, falsificación, "
"acceso no autorizado y liberación no autorizada."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_034
msgid ""
"The organization shall identify and meet the requirements regarding the "
"preservation of privacy and protection of PII according to applicable laws "
"and regulations and contractual requirements."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe identificar y cumplir los requisitos relacionados con "
"la preservación de la privacidad y la protección de la IIP de acuerdo con "
"las leyes y regulaciones aplicables y los requisitos contractuales."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_035
msgid ""
"The organization's approach to managing information security and its "
"implementation including people, processes and technologies shall be "
"reviewed independently at planned intervals, or when significant changes "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"El enfoque de la organización para gestionar la seguridad de la información "
"y su implementación, incluidas las personas, procesos y tecnologías, debe "
"revisarse de forma independiente en intervalos planificados o cuando se "
"produzcan cambios significativos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_036
msgid ""
"Compliance with the organization's information security policy, topic-"
"specific policies, rules and standards shall be regularly reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Se debe revisar periódicamente el cumplimiento de la política de seguridad "
"de la información de la organización, las políticas específicas, las reglas "
"y las normas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_037
msgid ""
"Operating procedures for information processing facilities shall be "
"documented and made available to personnel who need them."
msgstr ""
"Los procedimientos operativos para las instalaciones de procesamiento de "
"información deben documentarse y ponerse a disposición del personal que los "
"necesite."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_038
msgid ""
"Background verification checks on all candidates to become personnel shall "
"be carried out prior to joining the organization and on an ongoing basis "
"taking into consideration applicable laws, regulations and ethics and be "
"proportional to the business requirements, the classification of the "
"information to be accessed and the perceived risks."
msgstr ""
"Los controles de verificación de antecedentes de todos los candidatos para "
"convertirse en personal deben llevarse a cabo antes de unirse a la "
"organización y de manera continua, teniendo en cuenta las leyes, "
"regulaciones y ética aplicables, y ser proporcionales a los requisitos del "
"negocio, la clasificación de la información a la que se accede y a los "
"riesgos percibidos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_039
msgid ""
"The employment contractual agreements shall state the personnel's and the "
"organization's responsibilities for information security."
msgstr ""
"Los acuerdos contractuales de empleo deben establecer las responsabilidades "
"del personal y de la organización con respecto a la seguridad de la "
"información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_040
msgid ""
"Personnel of the organization and relevant interested parties shall receive "
"appropriate information security awareness, education and training and "
"regular updates of the organization's information security policy, topic-"
"specific policies and procedures, as relevant for their job function."
msgstr ""
"El personal de la organización y las partes interesadas pertinentes deben "
"recibir una adecuada concientización, educación y capacitación en seguridad "
"de la información, así como actualizaciones periódicas de la política de "
"seguridad de la información de la organización, políticas y procedimientos "
"específicos, según sea pertinente para su función laboral."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_041
msgid ""
"A disciplinary process shall be formalized and communicated to take actions "
"against personnel and other relevant interested parties who have committed "
"an information security policy violation."
msgstr ""
"Se debe formalizar y comunicar un proceso disciplinario para tomar acciones "
"contra el personal y otras partes interesadas pertinentes que hayan cometido"
" una violación de la política de seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_042
msgid ""
"Information security responsibilities and duties that remain valid after "
"termination or change of employment shall be defined, enforced and "
"communicated to relevant personnel and other interested parties."
msgstr ""
"Las responsabilidades y obligaciones en materia de seguridad de la "
"información que siguen siendo válidos después del cese o cambio de empleo "
"deben definirse, aplicarse y comunicarse al personal pertinente y otras "
"partes interesadas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_043
msgid ""
"Confidentiality or non-disclosure agreements reflecting the organization's "
"needs for the protection of information shall be identified, documented, "
"regularly reviewed and signed by personnel and other relevant interested "
"parties."
msgstr ""
"Los acuerdos de confidencialidad o no divulgación que reflejen las "
"necesidades de la organización para la protección de la información deben "
"ser identificados, documentados, revisados regularmente y firmados por el "
"personal y otras partes interesadas pertinentes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_044
msgid ""
"Security measures shall be implemented when personnel are working remotely "
"to protect information accessed, processed or stored outside the "
"organization's premises."
msgstr ""
"Se debe implementar medidas de seguridad cuando el personal trabaja de forma"
" remota para proteger la información accedida, procesada o almacenada fuera "
"de las instalaciones de la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_045
msgid ""
"The organization shall provide a mechanism for personnel to report observed "
"or suspected information security events through appropriate channels in a "
"timely manner."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe proporcionar un mecanismo para que el personal informe "
"eventos de seguridad de la información observados o bajo sospecha a través "
"de los canales apropiados de manera oportuna."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_046
msgid ""
"Security perimeters shall be defined and used to protect areas that contain "
"information and other associated assets."
msgstr ""
"Los perímetros de seguridad deben definirse y utilizarse para proteger las "
"áreas que contienen información y otros activos asociados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_047
msgid ""
"Secure areas shall be protected by appropriate entry controls and access "
"points."
msgstr ""
"Las áreas seguras deben estar protegidas por controles de entrada y puntos "
"de acceso adecuados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_048
msgid ""
"Physical security for offices, rooms and facilities shall be designed and "
"implemented."
msgstr ""
"Se debe diseñar e implementar la seguridad física para oficinas, salas e "
"instalaciones."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_049
msgid ""
"Premises shall be continuously monitored for unauthorized physical access."
msgstr ""
"Las instalaciones deben ser monitoreadas continuamente para detectar accesos"
" físicos no autorizados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_050
msgid ""
"Protection against physical and environmental threats, such as natural "
"disasters and other intentional or unintentional physical threats to "
"infrastructure shall be designed and implemented."
msgstr ""
"Se debe diseñar e implementar protección contra amenazas físicas y "
"ambientales, como desastres naturales y otras amenazas físicas intencionales"
" o no intencionales a la infraestructura."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_051
msgid ""
"Security measures for working in secure areas shall be designed and "
"implemented."
msgstr ""
"Deben diseñarse e implementarse medidas de seguridad para trabajar en áreas "
"seguras."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_052
msgid ""
"Clear desk rules for papers and removable storage media and clear screen "
"rules for information processing facilities shall be defined and "
"appropriately enforced."
msgstr ""
"Deben definirse y aplicarse adecuadamente reglas, de papeles y medios de "
"almacenamiento extraíbles y reglas de pantalla limpia en las instalaciones "
"de procesamiento de información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_053
msgid "Equipment shall be sited securely and protected."
msgstr "Los equipos deben estar ubicados de forma segura y protegidos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_054
msgid "Off-site assets shall be protected."
msgstr "Los activos fuera del sitio deben protegerse."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_055
msgid ""
"Storage media shall be managed through their life cycle of acquisition, use,"
" transportation and disposal in accordance with the organization's "
"classification scheme and handling requirements."
msgstr ""
"Los medios de almacenamiento deben gestionarse a lo largo de su ciclo de "
"vida de adquisición, uso, transporte y eliminación de acuerdo con el esquema"
" de clasificación de la organización y los requisitos de manipulación."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_056
msgid ""
"Information processing facilities shall be protected from power failures and"
" other disruptions caused by failures in supporting utilities."
msgstr ""
"Las instalaciones de procesamiento de información deben protegerse de cortes"
" de energía y otras interrupciones causadas por fallas en los servicios de "
"suministro de apoyo."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_057
msgid ""
"Cables carrying power, data or supporting information services shall be "
"protected from interception, interference or damage."
msgstr ""
"Los cables que transportan energía, datos o servicios de información de "
"apoyo deben protegerse contra interceptaciones, interferencias o daños."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_058
msgid ""
"Equipment shall be maintained correctly to ensure availability, integrity "
"and confidentiality of information."
msgstr ""
"El equipo debe mantenerse correctamente para asegurar la disponibilidad, "
"integridad y confidencialidad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_059
msgid ""
"Items of equipment containing storage media shall be verified to ensure that"
" any sensitive data and licensed software has been removed or securely "
"overwritten prior to disposal or re-use."
msgstr ""
"Los elementos del equipo que contienen medios de almacenamiento deben "
"verificarse para asegurar que los datos sensibles y el software con licencia"
" se hayan eliminado o sobrescrito de forma segura antes de su eliminación o "
"reutilización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_060
msgid ""
"Information stored on, processed by or accessible via user endpoint devices "
"shall be protected."
msgstr ""
"La información almacenada, procesada o accesible a través de dispositivos "
"terminales de usuario debe protegerse."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_061
msgid ""
"The allocation and use of privileged access rights shall be restricted and "
"managed."
msgstr ""
"La asignación y el uso de derechos de acceso privilegiado deben restringirse"
" y administrarse."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_062
msgid ""
"Access to information and other associated assets shall be restricted in "
"accordance with the established topic-specific policy on access control."
msgstr ""
"El acceso a la información y otros activos asociados debe restringirse de "
"acuerdo con la política específica establecida sobre control de acceso."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_063
msgid ""
"Read and write access to source code, development tools and software "
"libraries shall be appropriately managed."
msgstr ""
"El acceso de lectura y escritura al código fuente, las herramientas de "
"desarrollo y las librerías de software debe administrarse adecuadamente."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_064
msgid ""
"Secure authentication technologies and procedures shall be implemented based"
" on information access restrictions and the topic-specific policy on access "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Se deben implementar tecnologías y procedimientos de autenticación seguros "
"en función de las restricciones de acceso a la información y la política "
"específica sobre el control de acceso."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_065
msgid ""
"The use of resources shall be monitored and adjusted in line with current "
"and expected capacity requirements."
msgstr ""
"El uso de recursos debe monitorearse y ajustarse de acuerdo con los "
"requisitos de capacidad actuales y esperados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_066
msgid ""
"Protection against malware shall be implemented and supported by appropriate"
" user awareness."
msgstr ""
"La protección contra programas maliciosos (malware) debe implementarse y "
"respaldarse mediante la toma de conciencia adecuada del usuario."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_067
msgid ""
"Information about technical vulnerabilities of information systems in use "
"shall be obtained, the organization's exposure to such vulnerabilities shall"
" be evaluated and appropriate measures shall be taken."
msgstr ""
"Se debe obtener información sobre las vulnerabilidades técnicas de los "
"sistemas de información en uso, se debe evaluar la exposición de la "
"organización a tales vulnerabilidades y se deben tomar las medidas "
"apropiadas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_068
msgid ""
"Configurations, including security configurations, of hardware, software, "
"services and networks shall be established, documented, implemented, "
"monitored and reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Las configuraciones, incluidas las configuraciones de seguridad, de "
"hardware, software, servicios y redes deben establecerse, documentarse, "
"implementarse, monitorearse y revisarse."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_069
msgid ""
"Information stored in information systems, devices or in any other storage "
"media shall be deleted when no longer required."
msgstr ""
"La información almacenada en sistemas de información, dispositivos o "
"cualquier otro medio de almacenamiento debe eliminarse cuando ya no sea "
"necesaria."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_070
msgid ""
"Data masking shall be used in accordance with the organization's topic-"
"specific policy on access control and other related topic-specific policies,"
" and business requirements, taking applicable legislation into "
"consideration."
msgstr ""
"El enmascaramiento de datos debe utilizarse de acuerdo con la política "
"específica de la organización sobre control de acceso, otras políticas "
"específicas relacionadas y los requisitos del negocio, teniendo en cuenta la"
" legislación aplicable."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_071
msgid ""
"Data leakage prevention measures shall be applied to systems, networks and "
"any other devices that process, store or transmit sensitive information."
msgstr ""
"Las medidas de prevención de fuga de datos deben aplicarse a los sistemas, "
"redes y otros dispositivos que procesan, almacenan o transmiten información "
"sensible."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_072
msgid ""
"Backup copies of information, software and systems shall be maintained and "
"regularly tested in accordance with the agreed topic-specific policy on "
"backup."
msgstr ""
"Las copias de respaldo de la información, el software y los sistemas deben "
"mantenerse y probarse regularmente de acuerdo con la política específica "
"establecida sobre copias de seguridad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_073
msgid ""
"Information processing facilities shall be implemented with redundancy "
"sufficient to meet availability requirements."
msgstr ""
"Las instalaciones de procesamiento de información deben implementarse con "
"suficiente redundancia para cumplir con los requisitos de disponibilidad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_074
msgid ""
"Logs that record activities, exceptions, faults and other relevant events "
"shall be produced, stored, protected and analysed."
msgstr ""
"Se deben producir, almacenar, proteger y analizar los registros que guarden "
"actividades, excepciones, fallas y otros eventos relevantes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_075
msgid ""
"Networks, systems and applications shall be monitored for anomalous "
"behaviour and appropriate actions taken to evaluate potential information "
"security incidents."
msgstr ""
"Las redes, los sistemas y las aplicaciones deben monitorearse para detectar "
"comportamientos anómalos y tomar acciones para evaluar posibles incidentes "
"de seguridad de la información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_076
msgid ""
"The clocks of information processing systems used by the organization shall "
"be synchronized to approved time sources."
msgstr ""
"Los relojes de los sistemas de procesamiento de información utilizados por "
"la organización deben sincronizarse para fuentes de tiempo aprobadas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_077
msgid ""
"The use of utility programs that can be capable of overriding system and "
"application controls shall be restricted and tightly controlled."
msgstr ""
"Se debe restringir y controlar estrictamente el uso de programas de utilidad"
" que puedan anular los controles del sistema y de las aplicaciones."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_078
msgid ""
"Procedures and measures shall be implemented to securely manage software "
"installation on operational systems."
msgstr ""
"Deben implementarse procedimientos y medidas para gestionar de forma segura "
"la instalación de software en sistemas operativos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_079
msgid ""
"Networks and network devices shall be secured, managed and controlled to "
"protect information in systems and applications."
msgstr ""
"Las redes y los dispositivos de red deben protegerse, administrarse y "
"controlarse para proteger la información en sistemas y aplicaciones."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_080
msgid ""
"Security mechanisms, service levels and service requirements of network "
"services shall be identified, implemented and monitored."
msgstr ""
"Deben identificarse, implementarse y monitorearse los mecanismos de "
"seguridad, los niveles de servicio y los requisitos de servicio de los "
"servicios de red."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_081
msgid ""
"Groups of information services, users and information systems shall be "
"segregated in the organization's networks."
msgstr ""
"Los grupos de servicios de información, usuarios y sistemas de información "
"deben estar segregados en las redes de la organización."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_082
msgid ""
"Access to external websites shall be managed to reduce exposure to malicious"
" content."
msgstr ""
"El acceso a sitios web externos debe administrarse para reducir la "
"exposición a contenido malicioso."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_083
msgid ""
"Rules for the effective use of cryptography, including cryptographic key "
"management, shall be defined and implemented."
msgstr ""
"Deben definirse e implementarse reglas para el uso eficaz de la "
"criptografía, incluida la gestión de claves criptográficas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_084
msgid ""
"Rules for the secure development of software and systems shall be "
"established and applied."
msgstr ""
"Deben establecerse y aplicarse reglas para el desarrollo seguro de software "
"y sistemas."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_085
msgid ""
"Information security requirements shall be identified, specified and "
"approved when developing or acquiring applications."
msgstr ""
"Los requisitos de seguridad de la información deben identificarse, "
"especificarse y aprobarse al desarrollar o adquirir aplicaciones."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_086
msgid ""
"Principles for engineering secure systems shall be established, documented, "
"maintained and applied to any information system development activities."
msgstr ""
"Los principios de ingeniería de sistemas seguros deben establecerse, "
"documentarse, mantenerse y aplicarse a cualquier actividad de desarrollo de "
"sistema de información."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_087
msgid "Secure coding principles shall be applied to software development."
msgstr ""
"Los principios de codificación segura deben aplicarse al desarrollo de "
"software."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_088
msgid ""
"Security testing processes shall be defined and implemented in the "
"development life cycle."
msgstr ""
"Los procesos de pruebas de seguridad deben definirse e implementarse en el "
"ciclo de vida del desarrollo."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_089
msgid ""
"The organization shall direct, monitor and review the activities related to "
"outsourced system development."
msgstr ""
"La organización debe dirigir, monitorear y revisar las actividades "
"relacionadas con el desarrollo de sistemas subcontratados."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_090
msgid ""
"Development, testing and production environments shall be separated and "
"secured."
msgstr ""
"Los entornos de desarrollo, prueba y producción deben estar separados y "
"protegidos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_091
msgid ""
"Changes to information processing facilities and information systems shall "
"be subject to change management procedures."
msgstr ""
"Los cambios en las instalaciones de procesamiento de información y los "
"sistemas de información deben estar sujetos a procedimientos de gestión de "
"cambios."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_092
msgid ""
"Test information shall be appropriately selected, protected and managed."
msgstr ""
"La información de las pruebas debe seleccionarse, protegerse y gestionarse "
"adecuadamente."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:cyber_2matrix.block.line,description_application:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.block_line_093
msgid ""
"Audit tests and other assurance activities involving assessment of "
"operational systems shall be planned and agreed between the tester and "
"appropriate management."
msgstr ""
"Las pruebas de auditoría y otras actividades de aseguramiento que involucren"
" la evaluación de los sistemas operativos deben planificarse y acordarse "
"entre el evaluador y la gerencia correspondiente."

