#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_1
msgid ""
"People without adequate permissions access sensitive information, either due"
" to failures in access controls or the exploitation of vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Personas sin permisos adecuados acceden a información sensible, ya sea por "
"fallos en los controles de acceso o por la explotación de vulnerabilidades."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_10
msgid ""
"Sophisticated attackers who specifically target an organization in order to "
"steal critical information over time."
msgstr ""
"Atacantes sofisticados que apuntan específicamente a una organización con el"
" objetivo de robar información crítica a lo largo del tiempo."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_11
msgid ""
"Improper configuration of systems, applications or networks that leaves "
"exploitable security gaps."
msgstr ""
"Configuración inapropiada de sistemas, aplicaciones o redes que dejan "
"brechas de seguridad explotables."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_12
msgid ""
"Employees who are not properly informed about security practices and the "
"associated risks, which increases the likelihood of incidents."
msgstr ""
"Empleados que no están debidamente informados sobre las prácticas de "
"seguridad y los riesgos asociados, lo que aumenta la probabilidad de "
"incidentes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_13
msgid ""
"Failing to follow the legal regulations and standards that apply to "
"information security can result in security breaches and penalties."
msgstr ""
"No seguir las regulaciones y normativas legales que aplican a la seguridad "
"de la información puede resultar en brechas de seguridad y sanciones."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_14
msgid ""
"Lack of effective monitoring and intrusion detection systems that make it "
"possible to quickly identify and respond to security incidents."
msgstr ""
"Falta de sistemas efectivos de monitoreo y detección de intrusiones que "
"permitan identificar y responder rápidamente a incidentes de seguridad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_2
msgid ""
"Employees are deceived into revealing confidential information or allowing "
"access to protected systems."
msgstr ""
"Empleados son engañados para revelar información confidencial o para "
"permitir el acceso a sistemas protegidos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_3
msgid ""
"Malicious software infects systems, compromising the integrity and "
"availability of data."
msgstr ""
"Software malicioso infecta los sistemas, comprometiendo la integridad y "
"disponibilidad de los datos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_4
msgid ""
"Inadvertent actions by employees, such as sending emails to the wrong "
"recipients or accidentally deleting important data."
msgstr ""
"Acciones inadvertidas de los empleados, como el envío de correos "
"electrónicos a destinatarios incorrectos o la eliminación accidental de "
"datos importantes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_5
msgid ""
"Flaws or weaknesses in applications and operating systems that can be "
"exploited by attackers."
msgstr ""
"Fallos o debilidades en las aplicaciones y sistemas operativos que pueden "
"ser explotados por atacantes."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_6
msgid ""
"Loss or theft of devices containing sensitive information, such as laptops, "
"mobile phones or external hard drives."
msgstr ""
"Pérdida o robo de dispositivos que contienen información sensible, como "
"laptops, teléfonos móviles o discos duros externos."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_7
msgid ""
"Lack of clear policies or deficient procedures that do not adequately "
"address security risks."
msgstr ""
"Falta de políticas claras o procedimientos deficientes que no abordan "
"adecuadamente los riesgos de seguridad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_8
msgid ""
"Hardware or network problems, such as server failures, power supply "
"interruptions or storage system problems."
msgstr ""
"Problemas en el hardware o en la red, como fallos en los servidores, "
"interrupciones en el suministro eléctrico o problemas en los sistemas de "
"almacenamiento."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,description:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_9
msgid ""
"Risks associated with third parties that handle or have access to the "
"organization's information, especially if they do not follow the same "
"security standards."
msgstr ""
"Riesgos asociados a terceros que manejan o tienen acceso a la información de"
" la organización, especialmente si no siguen las mismas normas de seguridad."

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_1
msgid "1. Unauthorized access"
msgstr "1. Acceso no autorizado"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_10
msgid "10. Targeted attacks (APT - Advanced Persistent Threats)"
msgstr "10. Ataques dirigidos (APT - Amenazas Persistentes Avanzadas)"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_11
msgid "11. Misconfigurations"
msgstr "11. Configuraciones incorrectas"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_12
msgid "12. Lack of training and awareness"
msgstr "12. Falta de capacitación y concienciación"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_13
msgid "13. Non-compliance with regulations"
msgstr "13. No cumplimiento de normativas"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_14
msgid "14. Insufficient monitoring and detection"
msgstr "14. Insuficiente monitoreo y detección"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_2
msgid "2. Phishing and social engineering attacks"
msgstr "2. Phishing y ataques de ingeniería social"

#. module: soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity
#: model:incident.incident.reason,name:soy_cybersecurity_cybersecurity.incident_reason_3
msgid "3. Malware and viruses"
